Received POST data: <QueryDict: {'csrfmiddlewaretoken': ['si5ZgkN0MqeczN1wwzFjK8KLx5hCkDWpYwrPp5fdb0JL3YdDEAQn5G6b5Lg0C7Dq'], 'product': ['fc30e85d-89f7-467a-9794-b1683c1540b6'], 'title': ['Iphone 12 Battey drain'], 'overall_rating': ['3'], 'performance_rating': ['4'], 'battery_rating': ['3'], 'camera_rating': ['5'], 'display_rating': ['4'], 'value_rating': ['4'], 'content': ['The iPhone 12 generally offers a strong user experience with its impressive performance, vibrant display, and capable camera system. However, the notable battery drain issue can be a significant drawback for daily use.'], 'likes': ['Performance: The iPhone 12, powered by the A14 Bionic chip, delivers excellent and consistent performance. Apps launch quickly, multitasking is smooth, and even demanding games run without a hitch. It handles everyday tasks and more intensive activities with ease, maintaining a fluid and responsive user experience.\r\n\r\nDisplay: The 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display is a major highlight. Colors are vibrant and accurate, blacks are deep, and the contrast is superb. Viewing content, Browse, and gaming are a pleasure on this sharp and bright screen. The Ceramic Shield front cover also adds a welcome layer of durability.\r\n\r\nCamera: The dual 12MP camera system (Wide and Ultra Wide) is very good. Photos are consistently sharp, with good detail, accurate colors, and impressive dynamic range. Night mode works exceptionally well, significantly improving low-light photography. Video recording, including Dolby Vision HDR, is also excellent, making it a reliable tool for capturing moments.'], 'improvements': ['Battery Life: The most significant area for improvement is the battery life. The iPhone 12 suffers from noticeable battery drain, particularly with moderate to heavy usage, especially when utilizing 5G connectivity. It often struggles to last a full day without needing a charge, which can be inconvenient for users on the go. Optimized battery management and a larger battery capacity would greatly enhance the user experience.'], 'issues': ['Battery Drain: As mentioned, the primary issue encountered is the rapid battery drain. This necessitates frequent charging, and without careful management (like disabling 5G or using Low Power Mode), the phone may not comfortably last through a typical day.'], 'recommendation': ['I would recommend the iPhone 12 to users who prioritize top-tier performance, a beautiful display, and a highly capable camera in a sleek package. However, potential buyers should be aware of and prepared for the battery drain issue, which might require changes in usage habits or carrying a portable charger. If battery longevity is a critical factor for you, consider newer iPhone models or be prepared to manage the battery actively.'], 'is_verified_purchase': ['on']}>, Files: <MultiValueDict: {'review_video': [<TemporaryUploadedFile: video.mp4 (video/mp4)>]}>, Initial form: {}
Review saved successfully! ID: 2e4f400d-7458-4722-87c9-ca5428c2fda3, Product: fc30e85d-89f7-467a-9794-b1683c1540b6, User: 9, Data: {'product': <Product: Iphone iphone 12 pro>, 'title': 'Iphone 12 Battey drain', 'content': 'The iPhone 12 generally offers a strong user experience with its impressive performance, vibrant display, and capable camera system. However, the notable battery drain issue can be a significant drawback for daily use.', 'overall_rating': 3, 'performance_rating': 4, 'battery_rating': 3, 'camera_rating': 5, 'display_rating': 4, 'value_rating': 4, 'likes': 'Performance: The iPhone 12, powered by the A14 Bionic chip, delivers excellent and consistent performance. Apps launch quickly, multitasking is smooth, and even demanding games run without a hitch. It handles everyday tasks and more intensive activities with ease, maintaining a fluid and responsive user experience.\r\n\r\nDisplay: The 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display is a major highlight. Colors are vibrant and accurate, blacks are deep, and the contrast is superb. Viewing content, Browse, and gaming are a pleasure on this sharp and bright screen. The Ceramic Shield front cover also adds a welcome layer of durability.\r\n\r\nCamera: The dual 12MP camera system (Wide and Ultra Wide) is very good. Photos are consistently sharp, with good detail, accurate colors, and impressive dynamic range. Night mode works exceptionally well, significantly improving low-light photography. Video recording, including Dolby Vision HDR, is also excellent, making it a reliable tool for capturing moments.', 'improvements': 'Battery Life: The most significant area for improvement is the battery life. The iPhone 12 suffers from noticeable battery drain, particularly with moderate to heavy usage, especially when utilizing 5G connectivity. It often struggles to last a full day without needing a charge, which can be inconvenient for users on the go. Optimized battery management and a larger battery capacity would greatly enhance the user experience.', 'issues': 'Battery Drain: As mentioned, the primary issue encountered is the rapid battery drain. This necessitates frequent charging, and without careful management (like disabling 5G or using Low Power Mode), the phone may not comfortably last through a typical day.', 'recommendation': 'I would recommend the iPhone 12 to users who prioritize top-tier performance, a beautiful display, and a highly capable camera in a sleek package. However, potential buyers should be aware of and prepared for the battery drain issue, which might require changes in usage habits or carrying a portable charger. If battery longevity is a critical factor for you, consider newer iPhone models or be prepared to manage the battery actively.', 'review_video': <TemporaryUploadedFile: video.mp4 (video/mp4)>, 'is_verified_purchase': True}
